! EOM-CCSD def2-SVP def2-SVP/C def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF
# Gas-phase NEUTRAL (protonated) CR2 chromophore, charge 0, closed shell.
# Canonical EOM-CCSD with transition moments, so the oscillator strength is
# reported alongside the excitation energy. Same geometry and basis as the
# TDDFT and STEOM rows, so the whole ladder is method-matched.
%maxcore 6000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%mdci
  NRoots 3
  DoRootWise true
  MaxIter 200
  NDav 400
end
* xyzfile 0 1 neutral_chromophore.xyz
